MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_001: Well then. What is the matter you wished to speak\nof? I see that you are quite agitated.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_002: Yeah, of course I am! Get the hell outta Dagda, you!
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_003: Why raise this now? You have some objection to my\nbeing here?
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_004: You're aligned with Vritra, aren't you? That's a\ndangerous thing for Solomon!
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_005: You have been made aware of my discussions with\nNuwa's captain and the Mediator, no?
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_006: That's not the issue! And anyway, how the hell did\nthey even believe you?
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_007: You claim to be Fabio, some missionary, but on the\ninside, you're Anacharsis of Agartha!
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_008: Like I can trust someone who goes around telling\nnothing but lies to serve Vritra!
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_009: Let us try a simple thought experiment. Say my\nevery action is devoted to advancing Vritra's aims.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_010: Yet, somehow, I have neglected to report the\nexistence of you and your friends. Strange!
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_011: Yeah, well, uh... Who knows what kind of wild\nschemes you've got going on.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_012: Ah, forget it! Enough with the talk—let's settle this\nwith combat! Hyaaa-HAH!
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_013: Dear me. Fists instead of words, is it? Cool\nyour temper!
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_014: Hraaah... Argh!
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_015: Your mind is but a simple thing, isn't it? Your actions\nare easy to predict, and even easier to evade.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_016: Even if you had a Heart Core...I daresay you would\nnot be suitable to serve as a Mediator.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_017: How the hell'd you know about that?!
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_018: I sensed something was odd about you from the off.\nIn Kunlun, I asked the captain what it was.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_019: You have the body of a Mediator, but without the\ncommensurate skill.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_020: I did hear that despite your lack of academic\nachievement, you are quite something in combat.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_021: But if you let your emotions rule you... Then Nuwa\nwill have birthed you for naught. Shame.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_022: Y-you pretentious little... You really said it, huh?!\nUgh...ow... I can't stand up...
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_023: While I commend your instinct to be wary of me,\nthat is the only thing about you I can commend.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_C_024: {SetColor=Gray}*sigh* It seems likely he will attack again. What a\nvexatious situation.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_001: Fabio! Someone told me the enemy got you good...\nYou OK?
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_002: If you are possessed of the smallest bit of concern...\nplease, no shouting. My wounds...
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_003: Damn, you're shaking... You look like death warmed\nover...
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_004: Thank you, I am well aware. And you now have me\nat a disadvantage. I cannot hope to defeat you.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_005: The hell? What, you think I came here to take you\nout or something?
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_006: That's ridiculous! Who would try to take someone\ndown when they're nearly dead to begin with?
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_007: Once again, driven by emotion, you have succumbed\nto shallow thinking.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_008: Killing me will not only ease your anxieties about me,\nit will also gain you a Heart Core. No?
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_009: One step closer to being a Mediator...more powerful,\nand longer-lived. This benefits Solomon too.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_010: Or is it empty talk? If I am truly your enemy, you\nshould wish to extinguish me. Is that not so?
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_011: Grrr...
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_012: HYAAH!
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_013: That is not me. That is a wall.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_014: The way I see it, anyone fighting this hard against\nmy enemy is my friend. So how could I kill you?
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_015: It's decided. I'm just going to have to trust you. And I\ndon't need some stupid Heart Core.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_016: I'm going to get stronger and stronger without all\nthat, and eventually I'll die. That's my path.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_017: You're serious?
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_018: Of course I am. I don't tell lies like some kind\nof coward.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_019: I see... Very well. I will let the matter drop.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_020: Hey... You seem like you're feeling a whole lot better.\nYou...don't even seem injured, actually...
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_021: Nothing gets past you. It was all an act to draw you\nin. I wanted you to try to kill me.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_022: Your constant provocations became quite irritating.\nIf you attacked first, I could kill you in self-defense.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_023: But it seems you have come to trust me. For my part,\nI have nothing more to say to you.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_024: Understand this, though. For now, I do sincerely\nintend to fight alongside you and your people.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_025: What the hell, man?! I knew I couldn't trust you!
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_026: So you don't trust me after all? What a little liar\nyou are. Hmhmhm.
MID_SE_Fab_Naz_B_027: Hang on. That's not what I— Ugh, damn you!